                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "37d02f34-8b3a-4d1b-be89-57f9dadf993c",
                        "entry_id": "dd4ac8aa-9a57-3bae-b45f-6981bdb3b0da",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "amphitryonnes"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "73c8bb97-c49c-40c4-ab0b-8d3b4d28a9d9",
                        "entry_id": "dd4ac8aa-9a57-3bae-b45f-6981bdb3b0da",
                        "tags": [
                            "masculine"
                        ],
                        "form": "amphitryon"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "92abd704-356e-3701-862f-c9e8a89a9073",
                        "entry_id": "dd4ac8aa-9a57-3bae-b45f-6981bdb3b0da",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Femme chez qui l’on est invité à manger."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "formal"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "dde43214-ffc1-4125-ae3e-c72d3ee85e0c",
                                "sense_id": "92abd704-356e-3701-862f-c9e8a89a9073",
                                "text": "Il adopta donc le plan d’Antonia, voulait aborder la hante sphère de sa profession, avoir un magnifique appartement, femme de chambre, voiture, et lutter avec notre belle amphitryonne, par exemple…"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "89763f65-ea35-4b32-8d3f-d479a4486856",
                                "sense_id": "92abd704-356e-3701-862f-c9e8a89a9073",
                                "text": "Mais il est certain que l’Amphitryonne peintresse hébergea d’illustres guerriers, parmi lesquels le prince Georges de Saxe et le vieux Guillaume lui-même, son proche voisin, momentanément installé à Ferrières et qui, passant un beau jour, daigna s’emplir à sa table."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0ec3c7d1-ec72-4314-a051-bb2876b9d5c1",
                        "source_entry_id": "dd4ac8aa-9a57-3bae-b45f-6981bdb3b0da",
                        "source_sense_id": "92abd704-356e-3701-862f-c9e8a89a9073",
                        "target_lang_word": "host",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "host",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "37b5daf8-4408-34cd-84dc-dfddba81ddc9",
                                        "entry_id": "117334ba-3885-3ce6-ae37-75e17cbf7014",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A multitude of people arrayed as an army; used also in religious senses, as: Heavenly host (of angels)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "af5a106d-8755-4a5e-84a4-923a50cf8eb5",
                                                "sense_id": "37b5daf8-4408-34cd-84dc-dfddba81ddc9",
                                                "text": "Why, Plugson, even thy own host is all in mutiny: Cotton is conquered; but the ‘bare backs’ — are worse covered than ever!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c2ce23df-9965-43e2-a55c-35e5e88fcf27",
                                                "sense_id": "37b5daf8-4408-34cd-84dc-dfddba81ddc9",
                                                "text": "All about the hosts of Mordor raged."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b5626188-a135-4086-b4e5-6390d77f3ff8",
                                                "sense_id": "37b5daf8-4408-34cd-84dc-dfddba81ddc9",
                                                "text": "By Lady Day the Scriptorium was ready to receive the \"copying and burrowing\" of the host of readers who had been directed by Furnivall for the past twenty years."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "93ce50b1-8353-4380-84e4-86bbae0d19b6",
                                                "sense_id": "37b5daf8-4408-34cd-84dc-dfddba81ddc9",
                                                "text": "the invading host that had sailed from Hellas in more than one thousand ships was of an unprecedented size."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "56be1493-b94e-351e-820b-2a7ae8873349",
                                        "entry_id": "117334ba-3885-3ce6-ae37-75e17cbf7014",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A large number of items; a large inventory."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "24f1101c-56ff-47f6-aa01-d6fdabb47453",
                                                "sense_id": "56be1493-b94e-351e-820b-2a7ae8873349",
                                                "text": "The dealer stocks a host of parts for my Model A."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ea5928fd-87ba-4904-b06f-9fbe38631832",
                                                "sense_id": "56be1493-b94e-351e-820b-2a7ae8873349",
                                                "text": "I wandered lonely as a cloud\nThat floats on high o'er vales and hills,\nWhen all at once I saw a crowd,\nA host, of golden daffodils; […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2f17e56b-f529-4073-872f-18e4decf8b4b",
                                                "sense_id": "56be1493-b94e-351e-820b-2a7ae8873349",
                                                "text": "A short time since, some friends drinking tea one summer evening at their residence near Maidenhead, with all the windows of the drawing-room open, there suddenly burst in a host of small flies, which covered the table and the furniture […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "050b8ec5-b6b7-434c-af1b-b0ff0d318d13",
                                                "sense_id": "56be1493-b94e-351e-820b-2a7ae8873349",
                                                "text": "England ran Tunisia ragged in that spell but were punished for missing a host of chances when Ferjani Sassi equalised from the penalty spot against the run of play after Kyle Walker was penalised for an elbow on Fakhreddine Ben Youssef."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "15043214-46ba-418e-8fb2-19ce12bfb621",
                                                "sense_id": "56be1493-b94e-351e-820b-2a7ae8873349",
                                                "text": "In the immediate term, there is a host of new operating procedures to be developed and to become familiarised with, in accordance with social distancing."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "host",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a2b09c46-f2c7-3483-95bd-35b63fdcf706",
                                        "entry_id": "ac4eded5-38a0-32ae-8655-b341c6d40aa3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One which receives or entertains a guest, socially, commercially, or officially."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "18677051-a7c3-484d-81f8-e7fcd4e1e2cf",
                                                "sense_id": "a2b09c46-f2c7-3483-95bd-35b63fdcf706",
                                                "text": "A good host is always considerate of the guest’s needs."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c0463451-3616-4ed3-aebc-2e64050a980c",
                                                "sense_id": "a2b09c46-f2c7-3483-95bd-35b63fdcf706",
                                                "text": "Time is like a fashionable host, / That slightly shakes his parting guest by the hand."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e91be1f7-8805-311e-b3b6-7f6df4e3d2d6",
                                        "entry_id": "ac4eded5-38a0-32ae-8655-b341c6d40aa3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One that provides a facility for an event."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "88a14029-ce07-3945-b1ea-3232eeefd70b",
                                        "entry_id": "ac4eded5-38a0-32ae-8655-b341c6d40aa3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person or organization responsible for running an event."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f0e30123-8d24-49f0-a7f5-28290fdf1ddf",
                                                "sense_id": "88a14029-ce07-3945-b1ea-3232eeefd70b",
                                                "text": "Our company is host of the annual conference this year."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5cc7335f-c4d1-354a-aa7b-84c9112acc89",
                                        "entry_id": "ac4eded5-38a0-32ae-8655-b341c6d40aa3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A moderator or master of ceremonies for a performance."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3f97ac7d-c282-4b2c-80ec-6d91795188ba",
                                                "sense_id": "5cc7335f-c4d1-354a-aa7b-84c9112acc89",
                                                "text": "The host was terrible, but the acts themselves were good."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c86aac14-345b-3bd0-9a2b-c067c537470a",
                                        "entry_id": "ac4eded5-38a0-32ae-8655-b341c6d40aa3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The primary member of a system, typically the member who fronts most often."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9823e4f7-f521-3f93-b02b-8b9f7751b733",
                                        "entry_id": "ac4eded5-38a0-32ae-8655-b341c6d40aa3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any computer attached to a network."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Internet"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "393a5db0-c0e7-33fe-951a-bad590042c5a",
                                        "entry_id": "ac4eded5-38a0-32ae-8655-b341c6d40aa3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A cell or organism which harbors another organism or biological entity, usually a parasite."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b91f6b82-ae9b-469e-a055-9d89b4814b60",
                                                "sense_id": "393a5db0-c0e7-33fe-951a-bad590042c5a",
                                                "text": "Viruses depend on the host that they infect in order to be able to reproduce."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ef6e43b8-4cc2-467b-8904-548799429dac",
                                                "sense_id": "393a5db0-c0e7-33fe-951a-bad590042c5a",
                                                "text": "A recent study explored the ecological variables that may contribute to bats’ propensity to harbor such zoonotic diseases by comparing them with another order of common reservoir hosts: rodents."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e6a92341-2c0c-316f-99b2-c0721d058ea2",
                                        "entry_id": "ac4eded5-38a0-32ae-8655-b341c6d40aa3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An organism bearing certain genetic material, with respect to its cells."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6d98ddd8-ebbf-4ea8-9756-3122819637bd",
                                                "sense_id": "e6a92341-2c0c-316f-99b2-c0721d058ea2",
                                                "text": "The so-called junk DNA is known, so far, to provide no apparent benefit to its host."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bc046b01-3eb1-3ba3-9007-612263ae3717",
                                        "entry_id": "ac4eded5-38a0-32ae-8655-b341c6d40aa3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A paid male companion offering conversation and in some cases sex, as in certain types of bar in Japan."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "host",
